4763:
I do have the option of saving to PDF, but I'm really
looking for a completely lossless format.  Especially
since Adam might do further processing on these, it's
best to do all the intermediate steps losslessly, then
use any lossy compression at the end.

I did figure out that IrFanView
(http://www.irfanview.com/) has a good batch
converter.  I think for the moment I'll save as TIFF
from the scanner, then convert all the files to PNG. 
Actually, it might not be a bad idea to convert some
of the old scans I have, just to free up some space on
my hard drive.



Paul

